(50,'2024-06-25',50,1,'Approval for 90% Daily Allowance for Dasho Chairman Mr. Phuntsho Tobgay & Payment of Air Ticket','<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Universal Postal Union (UPU) has sent an invitation to the Ministry of Infrastructure and Transport(MoIT)t, specifically addressed to the Hon\'ble Secretary, regarding the POC Standing Group Session/Meeting scheduled to take place from 1 July to 5 July 2024 in Bern, Switzerland.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Dasho Chairman has instructed Bhutan Post to provide funding for attending the POC Standing Group Session, and this request has been approved by Bhutan Post as per their letter reference number BP(C)/05/MD/CEO/2024-633 dated June 19, 2024, which was addressed to the officiating Chief HR Officer at MOIT. The funding is intended for the Dasho Chairman to participate in the POC Standing Group Session.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The table below presents the details of the 90% Daily Allowance entitled to the attend&nbsp; the POC Standing Group Session in Bern, Switzerland from 1 July to 5 July 2024:</span></p>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"8\">\r\n<p><strong>Daily Allowance Details for Hon\'ble Dasho Chairman</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p><a href=\"http://sl.no/\"><strong>Sl.No</strong></a></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p><strong>From</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p><strong>To</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p><strong>DATE</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p><strong>No.of Days</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p><strong>In USD</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p><strong>In Nu.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p><strong>Halt</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">1</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Paro</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bangkok</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\